        <help_text>Select whether you received first aid. First aid is the first and immediate assistance given to any person suffering from either a minor or serious illness or injury, with care provided to preserve life, prevent the condition from worsening, or to promote recovery. This may include the cleaning/disinfecting of the wound or application of a bandage (band aid). </help_text>
